    "$comment": "Changes to the base4h writer schema (smoke-context/base4h-*.schema.json) that pilotRequest applies, as it already swaps the flow shape enum. Paths are JSON pointers into that schema. Descriptions on answer fields are convention only (safe on shared defs, e.g. a repair schema); the writer's system text adds 'correct one first' for the hinge. v4.6: then remove every maxLength and every ^.{1,N}$ pattern (pattern -> minLength 1) from the whole base schema; the result per stage is smoke-context/base4h-<stage>-v4.6.schema.json. Apply the same strip to any schema a repair call uses (pilotRepairSchema and the generic repair schema): the cut is the decoder's, so a capped repair schema cuts too.",
